{"id":"sentido","lemma":"sentido","pos":"noun","rank":360,"glosses":["sense (faculties of perception)","sense, way (manner)","sense, meaning"],"ipa":"/senˈtido/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"sentidos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sentido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me he sentido mejor.","en":"I've felt better.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442757"},{"text":"Esa palabra tiene dos sentidos.","en":"This word has two meanings.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937543"},{"text":"Eso es sentido común.","en":"That's common sense.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450209"},{"text":"Eres un paisaje para los sentidos.","en":"You're a sight for sore eyes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803924"},{"text":"Eso no tiene sentido.","en":"This makes no sense.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450059"}]}